<!-- Teaching layer over the approved blueprint source 4520147. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A cashier takes a card while the terminal has lost its connection. The store needs a receipt and a clear decision about whether the payment is confirmed. Trace the provider result before presenting success to the cashier.</p>

<!-- @before Failure Modes :: staff -->
### Make pending authorization visible at the counter

Keep the operation until the provider status can be verified. An approved receipt follows verified approval. Pending authorization or forwarding needs a pending label. If the merchant accepts offline risk under the provider’s contract, state that risk on the receipt and reconcile after reconnect. [Stripe Terminal offline operation](https://docs.stripe.com/terminal/features/operate-offline/overview?reader-type=bluetooth).
